WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.020 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 13=

01:51.760 --> 01:53.190
You just got assigned a unit,

01:53.190 --> 01:54.670
and you're already eyeing a TV?

01:55.660 --> 01:57.970
Aren't you asking too much too fast?

01:58.890 --> 01:59.730
No.

02:00.330 --> 02:01.420
I was just asking.

02:01.610 --> 02:04.010
Alright, stop overthinking it.

02:04.250 --> 02:06.190
He doesn't get the final say
on TV coupons.

02:06.400 --> 02:07.740
Not to mention him,

02:08.170 --> 02:10.420
our factory barely hands out two a year.

02:11.770 --> 02:13.690
Even the section chiefs

02:14.000 --> 02:15.180
can't get one.

02:15.730 --> 02:18.370
With your seniority and position?

02:18.770 --> 02:20.100
Not a chance.

02:21.700 --> 02:23.270
Then can we just buy one?

02:25.040 --> 02:26.190
Buy it?

02:27.140 --> 02:28.360
Forget the TV itself.

02:28.360 --> 02:29.530
Just that one coupon

02:29.890 --> 02:31.330
would cost four or five hundred.

02:31.650 --> 02:32.250
That much?

02:32.250 --> 02:32.830
Of course!

02:33.004 --> 02:34.290
If you didn't spend a cent,

02:34.404 --> 02:36.210
you'd have to save
for more than half a year.

02:36.210 --> 02:37.170
Forget it.

02:42.260 --> 02:43.100
Listen,

02:43.100 --> 02:44.140
Comrade Fei Ni,

02:44.890 --> 02:46.820
stop letting your mind wander.

02:47.530 --> 02:48.230
This month,

02:48.230 --> 02:49.300
our workshop

02:49.300 --> 02:51.450
is going to exceed the quota.

02:52.170 --> 02:53.020
Got it.

02:53.450 --> 02:54.350
Focus on your work.

02:55.140 --> 02:55.700
Let's go.

02:55.860 --> 02:56.420
Yeah.

02:57.940 --> 02:59.315
(In times of hardship,)

02:59.315 --> 03:01.700
(we must see our achievements
and see the light ahead,)

03:01.700 --> 03:03.300
(and bolster our resolve.)

03:07.420 --> 03:07.890
Fei Ni.

03:09.700 --> 03:10.730
Comrade Feng Lin.

03:11.890 --> 03:12.770
What brings you here?

03:13.930 --> 03:15.610
You moved into a new place,

03:15.626 --> 03:17.610
and I never got the chance
to congratulate you.

03:18.380 --> 03:19.770
I had some time today,

03:20.170 --> 03:21.050
so I came by.

03:21.820 --> 03:22.490
Is that so?

03:23.280 --> 03:24.170
Comrade Feng Lin,

03:24.810 --> 03:26.320
haven't you already congratulated us?

03:28.700 --> 03:29.700
When?

03:29.920 --> 03:30.700
Forgotten?

03:31.330 --> 03:32.980
Thanks to the paint you splashed,

03:33.093 --> 03:35.010
we got the inspiration
to decorate the place.

03:39.820 --> 03:42.210
So how did you decorate your new home?

03:43.020 --> 03:44.020
I'd like to see.

03:54.250 --> 03:54.740
Come on.

03:55.093 --> 03:56.140
Don't just stand there.

03:56.980 --> 03:57.730
Fang Muyang,

03:58.700 --> 04:00.630
I just remembered, we've got nothing

04:00.630 --> 04:01.330
at home.

04:01.700 --> 04:02.770
There's money in this bag.

04:02.770 --> 04:04.610
Go buy some food and drinks.

04:04.730 --> 04:05.950
We should properly host

04:05.950 --> 04:06.700
Comrade Feng Lin.

04:07.610 --> 04:08.020
Alright.

04:08.770 --> 04:09.350
No need.

04:09.350 --> 04:10.490
- We're neighbors.
- Feng Lin.

04:10.490 --> 04:12.610
- No need to be so formal.
- Let's head upstairs first.

04:12.610 --> 04:13.970
Fang Muyang

04:13.970 --> 04:15.330
is just very hospitable.

04:15.380 --> 04:16.530
You really didn't have to

04:16.530 --> 04:17.770
bring all these things.

04:17.770 --> 04:18.500
It's only right.

04:26.650 --> 04:28.060
You and Fang Muyang...

04:28.090 --> 04:28.700
Are you two...

04:29.380 --> 04:30.940
sleeping alright together?

04:30.940 --> 04:32.290
Don't even get me started.

04:32.290 --> 04:33.450
Everything in that place

04:33.450 --> 04:34.700
was set up by Fang Muyang.

04:40.500 --> 04:41.090
This way.

04:41.970 --> 04:42.650
I know.

04:52.820 --> 04:53.970
The key's in the bag.

04:54.140 --> 04:56.080
Fang Muyang took the bag.

04:56.080 --> 04:57.900
He went to buy things for you.

04:57.900 --> 04:58.530
Right, right.

04:58.530 --> 04:59.740
The wallet's in there, too.

05:00.330 --> 05:01.210
Well...

05:01.330 --> 05:02.380
Maybe...

05:02.940 --> 05:03.600
another day?

05:03.700 --> 05:04.290
It's fine.

05:06.090 --> 05:06.940
I can wait.

05:25.290 --> 05:26.530
What was that?

05:28.410 --> 05:29.380
Is someone in your house?

05:30.650 --> 05:31.380
A mouse.

05:31.770 --> 05:33.137
- A mouse?
- Yeah, a mouse.

05:33.380 --> 05:33.960
Right.

05:33.960 --> 05:35.760
- You have mice?
- I'm telling you, Feng Lin,

05:36.260 --> 05:37.740
the mice in our place are this big.

05:37.740 --> 05:38.530
Look.

05:39.820 --> 05:41.940
Then you really need to deal with that.

05:41.940 --> 05:42.740
Yes, yes.

05:42.740 --> 05:43.510
You sure it's fine?

05:43.510 --> 05:44.620
Really, it's fine.

05:44.620 --> 05:45.910
Mice, they...

05:46.826 --> 05:49.310
- They have a whole litter at once.
- They do?

05:49.310 --> 05:50.940
A whole litter at once...

05:50.940 --> 05:52.940
They love eating sugar...

05:52.940 --> 05:54.620
- Really?
- And biscuits, too.

05:54.740 --> 05:55.450
Big ones.

05:55.450 --> 05:56.970
Then you really should...

05:57.020 --> 05:57.780
Look at that,

05:58.020 --> 05:58.580
the flowers.

05:59.740 --> 06:00.530
They've all bloomed.

06:03.580 --> 06:04.740
Do you have mice at home?

06:04.740 --> 06:06.210
We're alright.

06:06.380 --> 06:07.270
Alright?

06:07.270 --> 06:08.530
So is that a yes or no?

06:08.740 --> 06:10.320
We haven't had any lately.

06:10.320 --> 06:10.800
Lately?

06:10.800 --> 06:11.400
Right.

06:12.380 --> 06:13.410
Ours are this big.

06:13.740 --> 06:14.380
This big?

06:15.910 --> 06:16.810
Impressive, huh.

06:33.170 --> 06:33.670
Fang Muyang.

06:33.670 --> 06:34.460
Coming, coming.

06:35.500 --> 06:36.290
I'm back.

06:38.050 --> 06:38.830
Look at you.

06:39.510 --> 06:40.530
- The key.
- I mean...

06:41.850 --> 06:42.380
Yes.

06:42.410 --> 06:42.960
See?

06:42.960 --> 06:44.715
I left in such a rush
that I forgot the key.

06:44.715 --> 06:46.180
You kept Feng Lin waiting.

06:46.180 --> 06:48.020
Here it is, right here.

06:50.620 --> 06:51.330
Please, come in.

07:04.700 --> 07:05.890
What a huge painting.

07:07.004 --> 07:08.210
You deserve some credit for it.

07:17.290 --> 07:17.850
Fei Ni,

07:17.982 --> 07:19.493
where's the leftover wedding candy?

07:19.620 --> 07:20.270
In the cabinet.

07:23.940 --> 07:24.330
Here.

07:26.426 --> 07:27.604
- What's wrong?
- Fei Ni!

07:28.020 --> 07:28.630
Look.

07:28.937 --> 07:29.820
There it is again.

07:32.340 --> 07:33.360
That big mouse.

07:33.660 --> 07:34.970
I'll deal with it later.

07:34.970 --> 07:37.210
I used to be a model
in the Four Pests campaign.

07:37.700 --> 07:38.770
I'll get you another piece.

07:38.910 --> 07:39.510
No need.

07:39.510 --> 07:40.160
Have a taste.

07:40.500 --> 07:40.860
Yes.

07:40.860 --> 07:41.604
Really, no need.

07:42.160 --> 07:43.089
Then try some of this.

07:43.090 --> 07:44.640
- Have this.
- Don't trouble yourself.

07:48.850 --> 07:50.420
You two newlyweds

07:51.680 --> 07:52.910
sleep on the lower bunk?

07:54.130 --> 07:55.090
Isn't it cramped?

07:55.520 --> 07:56.160
Not at all.

07:56.450 --> 07:57.470
We're both pretty slim.

07:57.580 --> 07:58.380
We're used to it.

08:13.380 --> 08:14.450
Look at this little desk.

08:15.340 --> 08:16.650
The drawer...

08:17.471 --> 08:18.582
What are you doing?

08:21.290 --> 08:21.770
This...

08:21.980 --> 08:24.020
(Condoms)

08:24.240 --> 08:24.730
So...

08:25.940 --> 08:28.090
You've been married quite a while,

08:28.450 --> 08:29.780
and the ones the factory issued

08:29.937 --> 08:31.180
haven't been used at all?

08:34.620 --> 08:35.200
Nope.

08:39.140 --> 08:40.100
Not used?

08:41.340 --> 08:42.540
Or couldn't use them?

08:45.530 --> 08:46.140
Couldn't.

08:46.770 --> 08:48.020
These are too small.

08:49.400 --> 08:49.950
Feng Lin,

08:50.260 --> 08:51.500
you wouldn't know.

08:51.500 --> 08:52.690
They come in different sizes.

08:52.690 --> 08:54.050
It's about the fit...

08:54.590 --> 08:55.520
Okay, stop explaining.

09:01.410 --> 09:03.380
Fang Muyang, show some manners.

09:03.980 --> 09:05.140
What's wrong?

09:05.500 --> 09:06.620
We're married.

09:06.860 --> 09:07.810
I could be even bolder.

09:08.460 --> 09:09.330
Alright.

09:10.220 --> 09:11.140
You're impossible.

09:11.620 --> 09:12.690
We have a guest.

09:12.980 --> 09:13.650
Someone's here.

09:13.650 --> 09:14.340
Alright!

09:17.800 --> 09:18.480
Sorry about that.

09:19.890 --> 09:20.610
It's fine.

09:21.340 --> 09:21.930
It's good.

09:21.980 --> 09:23.150
Seeing you two like this

09:23.150 --> 09:23.980
puts me at ease.

09:25.930 --> 09:26.810
Well then, I...

09:27.500 --> 09:28.380
I won't disturb you.

09:28.770 --> 09:29.600
There's work to do.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.220
Stay for dinner.

09:30.220 --> 09:30.890
Yes, stay.

09:30.890 --> 09:32.260
- No need.
- Have a bite.

09:32.260 --> 09:32.840
Take care.

09:36.530 --> 09:37.390
That was terrifying.

09:45.050 --> 09:45.860
Feng Lin.

09:45.980 --> 09:46.980
What brings you here?

09:46.980 --> 09:49.020
I came to see Fei Ni.

09:50.220 --> 09:51.680
You two are close now?

09:52.450 --> 09:53.810
Chief Wang, off work?

09:53.810 --> 09:54.782
Going to buy groceries?

09:55.170 --> 09:55.690
Go on.

09:57.740 --> 09:58.220
Chief Wang.

09:58.740 --> 09:59.170
Yes?

10:00.690 --> 10:01.370
Chief Wang,

10:02.020 --> 10:03.440
you live next door to Fei Ni.

10:04.100 --> 10:05.620
Haven't you noticed anything strange?

10:07.220 --> 10:08.290
Strange how?

10:08.740 --> 10:09.600
Today,

10:09.920 --> 10:11.500
I happened to see

10:11.840 --> 10:14.060
the family planning supplies
she picked up before.

10:14.980 --> 10:16.382
Not a single one's been opened.

10:21.750 --> 10:23.140
Now that you mention it,

10:23.220 --> 10:24.460
it is a little strange.

10:26.220 --> 10:28.570
Chief Wu and his wife
used to live next door.

10:28.570 --> 10:29.620
Every few days,

10:29.620 --> 10:30.810
you'd hear some noise.

10:31.620 --> 10:34.020
Now Fei Ni
and her young husband are here.

10:34.380 --> 10:35.740
They've been married a while,

10:36.460 --> 10:38.500
but every night, it's completely quiet.

10:38.500 --> 10:39.220
And besides,

10:39.500 --> 10:41.570
what newlyweds in a real marriage

10:41.620 --> 10:42.980
buy bunk beds?

10:45.390 --> 10:46.380
Once you step inside

10:46.500 --> 10:47.340
that place,

10:47.620 --> 10:49.250
it's cleaner than the palm of my hand.

10:50.570 --> 10:52.220
Does that look lived in?

10:55.020 --> 10:56.570
Looks like it's just for show.

10:56.570 --> 10:57.530
Right?

10:58.380 --> 10:59.890
When the factory assigned housing,

10:59.893 --> 11:02.093
Fang Muyang was supposed
to wait for the next round.

11:03.020 --> 11:05.100
It was only because
he suddenly got married

11:05.570 --> 11:08.410
that the factory had no choice
but to give him a unit.

11:09.170 --> 11:10.380
So what you're saying is...

11:11.690 --> 11:12.570
I heard that

11:14.140 --> 11:16.840
when No.3 Textile Factory
assigned housing before,

11:17.410 --> 11:18.380
they uncovered

11:18.770 --> 11:20.260
people who got fake marriages

11:20.740 --> 11:21.770
just to get a unit.

11:25.560 --> 11:26.170
Of course,

11:26.570 --> 11:27.530
I'm not saying

11:27.620 --> 11:28.910
Fang Muyang and Fei Ni

11:29.290 --> 11:30.740
are definitely doing the same.

11:31.500 --> 11:32.430
But don't you think

11:32.640 --> 11:34.340
this is all too strange?

11:34.340 --> 11:35.410
Too much of a coincidence?

11:36.500 --> 11:37.980
This could be serious.

11:39.410 --> 11:41.260
But it's not easy to prove it.

11:43.770 --> 11:44.340
Chief Wang,

11:45.100 --> 11:46.140
here's what I think.

11:47.290 --> 11:49.690
Out of responsibility to the factory,

11:50.020 --> 11:51.530
since we've noticed a problem,

11:51.890 --> 11:53.100
we can't just ignore it.

11:54.220 --> 11:55.770
As for how the leadership handles it,

11:56.140 --> 11:57.170
that's up to them.

11:58.140 --> 11:59.100
Don't you agree?

12:02.220 --> 12:03.020
You're right.

12:05.100 --> 12:06.290
Let's report it

12:06.460 --> 12:07.300
to Ms. Xu.

12:07.340 --> 12:08.080
Right away.

12:08.570 --> 12:09.100
Let's go.

12:12.500 --> 12:13.340
Let's go.

12:23.540 --> 12:26.180
(TV Coupon Savings Plan)

12:26.480 --> 12:29.500
Still short by over three hundred.

12:33.770 --> 12:35.930
After what Feng Lin pulled today,

12:36.620 --> 12:37.410
I'm exhausted.

12:39.937 --> 12:40.930
What are you busy with?

12:41.950 --> 12:42.650
Nothing.

12:44.890 --> 12:45.470
By the way,

12:45.890 --> 12:47.630
we need to be
more careful from now on.

12:47.630 --> 12:48.270
In the morning,

12:48.270 --> 12:49.660
we have to put the quilts away.

12:50.170 --> 12:50.860
Got it.

12:56.340 --> 12:57.050
This is the room.

12:57.790 --> 12:58.240
Open up.

13:01.810 --> 13:03.060
I want to see for myself

13:03.290 --> 13:04.500
what you two...

13:05.020 --> 13:05.710
Who's there?

13:06.860 --> 13:07.600
What are you doing?

13:10.500 --> 13:10.990
Well...

13:11.380 --> 13:12.260
Comrade Fang Muyang,

13:12.980 --> 13:13.680
you two,

13:14.040 --> 13:14.920
put your coats on.

13:16.380 --> 13:17.570
You barged in here.

13:17.570 --> 13:18.810
What's there not to see?

13:21.100 --> 13:21.810
Fei Ni,

13:21.848 --> 13:24.115
I suspect you and Fang Muyang
are in a fake marriage.

13:27.040 --> 13:28.170
Comrade Feng Lin,

13:28.890 --> 13:30.290
what exactly do you mean by that?

13:34.460 --> 13:35.520
Ms. Xu,

13:35.648 --> 13:37.020
it's the middle of the night.

13:37.460 --> 13:40.140
What have Fang Muyang and I done wrong?

13:42.740 --> 13:43.740
Chief Wang said

13:43.980 --> 13:46.100
you two set up bunk beds at home,

13:46.100 --> 13:47.471
and ever since you got married,

13:47.471 --> 13:49.360
there hasn't been a sound
from your place.

13:49.930 --> 13:50.500
Chief Wang,

13:51.460 --> 13:52.650
didn't I already explain?

13:53.020 --> 13:54.620
The top bunk is for storage.

13:54.740 --> 13:55.760
I told her that!

13:55.760 --> 13:56.620
Alright, enough.

13:58.410 --> 13:59.280
Since

13:59.280 --> 14:00.410
there's been a report,

14:00.740 --> 14:02.140
I have to verify it.

14:02.570 --> 14:03.500
Comrade Fang Muyang,

14:03.740 --> 14:04.360
Fei Ni,

14:04.410 --> 14:06.520
don't feel pressured.

14:06.960 --> 14:07.640
Alright?

14:07.770 --> 14:09.880
We've confirmed the truth of it,

14:10.170 --> 14:12.020
so everyone can
put their minds at ease.

14:12.020 --> 14:13.290
And that'll be the end of it.

14:13.690 --> 14:14.290
Ms. Xu.

14:17.890 --> 14:18.770
Confirmed, you said?

14:19.810 --> 14:20.960
How do you confirm this?

14:21.440 --> 14:22.620
How exactly?

14:22.740 --> 14:24.310
When I sleep with my wife,

14:24.380 --> 14:25.840
do I need to file a report

14:25.930 --> 14:27.120
and wait for approval?

14:27.570 --> 14:28.260
Chief Wang,

14:28.570 --> 14:29.620
we're neighbors.

14:29.770 --> 14:31.230
When I'm intimate with my wife,

14:31.230 --> 14:32.570
I don't dare make a sound,

14:32.570 --> 14:33.940
for fear of disturbing you.

14:34.220 --> 14:36.170
And this is what I get? Suspicion?

14:36.500 --> 14:37.170
Fine.

14:37.500 --> 14:38.430
From now on,

14:38.810 --> 14:39.430
the two of us

14:39.650 --> 14:40.730
won't hold back.

14:40.890 --> 14:42.190
We'll just do as we please.

14:42.190 --> 14:43.448
Let's see whose place is louder.

14:43.982 --> 14:45.980
Otherwise, you'll think
we're a fake couple.

14:45.980 --> 14:46.410
I didn't...

14:46.410 --> 14:47.740
She suspected...

14:48.340 --> 14:49.410
Comrade Feng Lin,

14:50.170 --> 14:50.910
I get it.

14:51.220 --> 14:53.160
It's because of this unit

14:53.160 --> 14:54.720
that you've always had it out for us.

14:55.390 --> 14:56.700
When you came earlier today,

14:56.910 --> 14:58.770
I honestly thought
you came to make peace.

14:59.170 --> 15:00.890
Turns out you were here to spy on us.

15:01.410 --> 15:03.260
You distrust Fang Muyang
and me that much?

15:03.500 --> 15:04.100
Fine.

15:04.380 --> 15:05.604
Then don't leave tonight.

15:05.620 --> 15:07.410
Stay and see if we're a real couple.

15:07.530 --> 15:08.010
No...

15:08.300 --> 15:09.050
Fei Ni, you...

15:09.050 --> 15:10.780
How can you
say something like that?

15:11.330 --> 15:12.890
You barged in and lifted our blankets.

15:13.340 --> 15:14.570
What is there I can't say?

15:15.071 --> 15:16.500
And don't just watch by yourselves.

15:16.650 --> 15:17.980
Let everyone come take a look.

15:17.980 --> 15:19.370
Come on, everyone, take a look.

15:19.382 --> 15:21.380
Let's see how Ms. Xu
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory

15:21.380 --> 15:22.540
and the Publicity Section Chief

15:22.540 --> 15:23.930
- show their concern for Fei Ni
- Alright, alright.

15:23.930 --> 15:25.900
by standing here,
watching her sleep with her husband!

15:25.900 --> 15:26.620
Fine!

15:27.160 --> 15:27.780
That's enough.

15:27.930 --> 15:29.670
Alright. Get back to sleep.

15:29.670 --> 15:30.460
It's late at night!

15:34.810 --> 15:35.740
Comrade Fang Muyang,

15:36.520 --> 15:37.120
Fei Ni,

15:37.250 --> 15:38.000
we have

15:38.480 --> 15:39.540
handled it poorly.

15:40.570 --> 15:41.780
We owe you an apology.

15:42.800 --> 15:44.170
Get some good rest.

15:44.337 --> 15:45.920
We'll talk about anything else tomorrow.

15:45.920 --> 15:46.420
Yes, yes.

15:46.420 --> 15:48.220
Tomorrow. We'll talk tomorrow.

16:02.010 --> 16:02.970
Are they gone?

16:17.180 --> 16:18.770
This is outrageous!

16:21.490 --> 16:22.130
Feng Lin,

16:22.420 --> 16:23.060
I know that

16:23.250 --> 16:24.490
because of the housing issue,

16:24.490 --> 16:26.700
you've held a grudge against Fei Ni.

16:26.770 --> 16:28.060
But spreading rumors

16:28.060 --> 16:29.650
comes with consequences.

16:29.700 --> 16:31.370
Especially when the person

16:31.700 --> 16:33.650
is a hero who saved lives.

16:33.650 --> 16:34.250
Tell me,

16:34.250 --> 16:36.490
if this incident got out,

16:36.700 --> 16:38.300
where would that leave me?

16:38.850 --> 16:39.850
I'm sorry, Ms. Xu.

16:40.820 --> 16:42.250
But I just wanted to find the truth.

16:42.250 --> 16:43.599
If their marriage really were fake,

16:43.600 --> 16:45.770
it'd be deception against
the organization and the Party.

16:45.782 --> 16:46.490
The truth?

16:47.970 --> 16:49.890
The truth is that their relationship

16:49.890 --> 16:51.540
is better than you think.

16:54.650 --> 16:55.580
And Chief Wang,

16:56.180 --> 16:57.250
as a leader

16:57.770 --> 16:58.890
and their neighbor,

16:59.100 --> 17:00.890
you should be setting an example.

17:01.420 --> 17:03.650
How could you

17:03.700 --> 17:05.300
doubt your own comrades?

17:05.580 --> 17:07.060
It's my fault, Ms. Xu.

17:07.060 --> 17:08.690
If something like this happens again,

17:08.690 --> 17:09.210
I will...

17:09.210 --> 17:10.380
Again?

17:13.300 --> 17:14.890
Good thing Comrade Fei Ni

17:14.890 --> 17:17.210
and Comrade Fang Muyang
are politically aware.

17:17.500 --> 17:19.500
Otherwise, if this had blown up,

17:20.060 --> 17:21.450
how do I even explain it

17:21.450 --> 17:22.540
to the leadership?

17:24.980 --> 17:26.130
You two are

17:26.130 --> 17:27.060
unbelievable!

17:28.890 --> 17:30.060
Reflect on this mistake!

17:30.060 --> 17:30.710
Ms. Xu, I was...

17:30.715 --> 17:31.500
Enough.

17:31.650 --> 17:32.650
Take care, Ms. Xu.

17:35.500 --> 17:36.610
Look at you.

17:37.170 --> 17:38.450
It wasn't a big deal,

17:38.450 --> 17:40.340
and you just had to
take it to Ms. Xu.

17:40.340 --> 17:41.500
How am I supposed to face them

17:41.500 --> 17:42.610
as neighbors now?

17:44.130 --> 17:44.980
Return the key!

17:56.850 --> 17:57.690
Fang Muyang,

17:58.500 --> 18:00.300
I'm still shaken.

18:00.370 --> 18:01.690
If they had found out,

18:01.980 --> 18:03.170
we'd be done for.

18:03.890 --> 18:05.780
Then shouldn't you thank me properly?

18:05.940 --> 18:09.380
(Men's Restroom)

18:17.315 --> 18:18.871
Thanks for your hard work, comrade.

18:20.580 --> 18:22.060
How did you know

18:22.060 --> 18:23.300
they were coming to expose us?

18:24.500 --> 18:25.650
Wang Xiaoman

18:25.650 --> 18:27.260
saw our bunk beds before

18:27.500 --> 18:28.650
and even asked me about them.

18:29.300 --> 18:31.690
And today, Feng Lin suddenly
showed up to congratulate us.

18:32.060 --> 18:33.100
She clearly had an agenda.

18:33.930 --> 18:34.490
Do you think,

18:34.850 --> 18:36.210
after tonight,

18:36.450 --> 18:38.370
they'll stop suspecting us?

18:38.760 --> 18:40.060
I don't know about the others,

18:40.850 --> 18:42.850
but Feng Lin will
definitely keep watching us.

18:45.100 --> 18:46.100
Then, what do we do?

18:47.360 --> 18:49.170
Looks like you'll have to bear with it.

18:56.490 --> 18:57.780
If we're exposed,

18:57.982 --> 18:59.260
they'll confiscate the unit.

19:01.210 --> 19:03.260
And Wang Xiaoman lives right next door.

19:03.690 --> 19:05.580
If you want to erase her doubts,

19:06.500 --> 19:07.780
you'll have to put up with it.

19:28.540 --> 19:30.340
Are you sure this is right?

19:30.340 --> 19:31.450
I think so.

19:31.537 --> 19:32.610
I've never done this before.

19:33.500 --> 19:34.260
So...

19:34.690 --> 19:35.890
How long do we shake it?

19:37.060 --> 19:38.500
The longer the better, I guess.

19:47.060 --> 19:48.690
Why are you up all of a sudden?

19:51.100 --> 19:52.100
You're worthless!

19:56.820 --> 19:57.610
Fang Muyang,

19:58.410 --> 19:59.820
can I talk to you about something?

20:00.610 --> 20:01.340
No need to ask.

20:02.100 --> 20:03.210
You call the shots at home.

20:04.048 --> 20:06.000
The money your sister
gave you this morning,

20:06.000 --> 20:07.650
can I borrow it for now?

20:08.340 --> 20:09.130
Of course.

20:12.390 --> 20:13.370
Did something happen?

20:15.910 --> 20:18.240
The Publicity Section has

20:18.670 --> 20:19.690
an opening right now.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.890
My brother's been looking for work.

20:22.500 --> 20:23.120
But,

20:23.340 --> 20:24.450
Chief Wang agreed.

20:25.060 --> 20:26.020
Isn't that a good thing?

20:28.250 --> 20:29.840
But she wants a TV coupon.

20:32.300 --> 20:33.260
A TV coupon?

20:37.590 --> 20:39.100
Where are we supposed to get that?

20:42.890 --> 20:43.820
You want to buy one?

20:45.690 --> 20:48.300
I've thought it through.
That's the only way.

20:48.315 --> 20:48.930
But don't worry.

20:48.930 --> 20:49.890
I'll pay you back.

20:50.170 --> 20:52.260
I'll go to the printing factory tomorrow

20:52.260 --> 20:53.020
to see Ms. Ma.

20:53.210 --> 20:54.300
I'll ask for extra paper.

20:55.000 --> 20:56.370
Even scraps add up.

20:56.370 --> 20:57.690
I'll save more that way.

21:13.004 --> 21:14.226
So, do we keep shaking?

21:15.780 --> 21:16.820
One thing at a time.

21:16.980 --> 21:17.820
Keep shaking.

21:29.130 --> 21:29.830
Fei Ni...

21:30.010 --> 21:32.180
Ms. Xu went
to inspect their place last night.

21:32.180 --> 21:32.930
I saw it, too.

21:37.100 --> 21:37.610
Ms. Liu.

21:38.020 --> 21:38.740
Ms. Sun.

21:39.020 --> 21:39.560
Fei Ni.

21:39.740 --> 21:40.130
Here.

21:41.130 --> 21:41.780
Take this.

21:41.782 --> 21:42.340
What?

21:42.340 --> 21:44.460
Second Workshop just
handed these out today. Go on.

21:44.850 --> 21:46.500
We all know about you and Fang Muyang...

21:48.450 --> 21:49.890
Don't be shy.

21:50.300 --> 21:52.000
Chief Wang told me everything.

21:53.271 --> 21:54.100
Use them freely.

21:54.300 --> 21:54.930
If you run out,

21:55.130 --> 21:56.060
I'll get you more.

21:56.410 --> 21:56.820
I...

21:57.170 --> 21:57.610
Alright.

21:58.060 --> 21:58.820
Have fun.

22:03.820 --> 22:04.930
Not bad, Fei Ni.

22:04.930 --> 22:05.820
Good taste.

22:12.060 --> 22:12.850
Fei Ni.

22:15.450 --> 22:16.020
Those...

22:16.690 --> 22:17.540
The dark circles...

22:18.300 --> 22:21.780
I absolutely believe you two
are the real deal.

22:23.300 --> 22:24.100
You two...

22:27.100 --> 22:28.650
Maybe keep it down a little.

22:29.610 --> 22:30.930
I'm begging you.

22:50.670 --> 22:51.400
Need anything?

22:51.737 --> 22:53.780
- There's more.
- Look at this thermos.

22:54.460 --> 22:55.230
It may look old,

22:56.600 --> 22:57.300
but it keeps heat.

22:57.300 --> 22:58.020
It really does.

22:58.382 --> 22:59.450
It doesn't say so on it.

22:59.450 --> 23:01.100
It keeps heat. See? Take a look.

23:04.937 --> 23:06.000
Young man, come here.

23:06.000 --> 23:06.480
Over here.

23:07.060 --> 23:07.850
Shanghai brand.

23:10.470 --> 23:11.770
This is a thermos.

23:13.170 --> 23:13.760
Young man!

23:13.760 --> 23:15.560
- Take a look at the radio.
- Come on over.

23:16.340 --> 23:17.340
It's in great condition.

23:17.915 --> 23:18.890
Excellent quality, too.

23:20.060 --> 23:20.650
Nice, right?

23:21.100 --> 23:21.650
Not bad.

23:22.060 --> 23:22.500
Like it?

23:22.500 --> 23:23.340
Take one if you do.

23:24.500 --> 23:25.490
I'll come back later.

23:27.450 --> 23:28.060
Young man,

23:28.093 --> 23:28.850
how about a watch?

23:28.850 --> 23:29.580
Shanghai brand.

23:31.130 --> 23:31.915
Oh, you have one.

23:32.980 --> 23:33.500
Young man.

23:35.140 --> 23:36.340
(Gao)

23:39.610 --> 23:40.850
I'm not buying that.

23:42.690 --> 23:43.840
What are you looking for?

23:48.540 --> 23:49.580
A TV.

23:56.570 --> 23:58.130
I fix watches pretty well, you know.

24:29.450 --> 24:29.930
Let's go.

25:27.580 --> 25:28.800
You really have one?

25:37.820 --> 25:38.980
Why is it just the shell?

25:39.300 --> 25:40.690
Ever heard of assembly?

25:45.300 --> 25:47.680
I paid a lot to piece this together.

25:48.760 --> 25:49.780
It may be secondhand,

25:49.890 --> 25:51.100
but all the parts are there.

25:55.210 --> 25:56.020
Will it work?

25:57.980 --> 25:58.540
Of course.

26:16.850 --> 26:17.450
I'm back.

26:18.580 --> 26:19.820
Why so late?

26:26.890 --> 26:29.100
What's all over your clothes?
They're filthy.

26:31.020 --> 26:32.100
Charcoal pencil smudges.

26:33.300 --> 26:33.890
Take it off.

26:33.937 --> 26:34.780
I'll wash it for you.

26:42.337 --> 26:43.650
Take off the false collar, too.

26:45.500 --> 26:47.210
Be more careful next time.

26:47.210 --> 26:48.450
Don't get it this dirty,

26:48.450 --> 26:49.980
or we'll have to buy a new one.

26:56.100 --> 26:57.540
You wash that yourself.

27:02.610 --> 27:03.820
What's the difference?

27:10.580 --> 27:10.980
Fei Ni,

27:11.471 --> 27:12.690
doing laundry this late?

27:14.300 --> 27:15.410
Fang Muyang got back late.

27:15.410 --> 27:16.826
I just washed it while I was at it.

27:17.820 --> 27:19.410
Fang Muyang's a lucky man.

27:20.500 --> 27:21.500
You're lucky, too.

27:27.210 --> 27:27.740
Fei Ni,

27:28.850 --> 27:30.610
about that TV coupon...

27:31.370 --> 27:32.020
Any progress?

27:34.610 --> 27:35.170
Soon.

27:35.650 --> 27:36.100
Very soon.

27:40.100 --> 27:41.020
Maybe forget it.

27:41.780 --> 27:42.500
I know

27:42.782 --> 27:43.915
this whole thing

27:44.004 --> 27:45.226
puts you in a tough spot.

27:45.780 --> 27:47.930
Chen'll retire in half a month.

27:50.210 --> 27:51.170
I need to fill the post.

27:51.690 --> 27:52.340
Chief Wang,

27:52.690 --> 27:54.060
can you give me a little more time?

27:54.337 --> 27:55.260
It's really close.

27:57.130 --> 27:58.500
But I need a clear answer.

27:58.740 --> 28:00.100
How much longer exactly?

28:01.500 --> 28:02.100
Chief Wang,

28:04.260 --> 28:04.890
ten days.

28:05.980 --> 28:07.020
Give us ten more days.

28:07.370 --> 28:08.610
You'll definitely get a TV.

28:09.580 --> 28:10.580
Take this coupon for now.

28:10.982 --> 28:12.537
Exchange it for the TV in ten days.

28:13.340 --> 28:14.300
(TV Purchase Coupon)

28:14.300 --> 28:15.410
A TV coupon!

28:18.690 --> 28:19.650
What size TV can I buy?

28:20.020 --> 28:20.740
You can get

28:21.020 --> 28:21.540
a 12-inch or

28:21.610 --> 28:22.370
a 14-inch.

28:22.671 --> 28:23.540
Depends on your luck.

28:24.060 --> 28:25.430
Alright. I'm not picky.

28:25.690 --> 28:26.500
Any size is fine.

28:27.980 --> 28:28.690
That's great.

28:29.300 --> 28:29.780
Fei Ni,

28:30.210 --> 28:30.740
have

28:31.060 --> 28:31.820
your brother

28:31.980 --> 28:32.930
get his paperwork ready.

28:34.780 --> 28:35.740
I'll get going then.

28:36.004 --> 28:36.930
Thank you, Chief Wang.

28:41.020 --> 28:41.980
Fang Muyang,

28:43.170 --> 28:44.650
where did you get that TV coupon?

28:45.130 --> 28:46.450
It must've cost a lot.

28:47.340 --> 28:48.690
I don't have that much right now,

28:49.170 --> 28:50.500
but I'll definitely pay you back.

28:50.820 --> 28:51.300
Alright.

28:52.210 --> 28:52.650
No rush.

29:00.210 --> 29:02.130
Guess what I managed to get.

29:04.930 --> 29:05.340
What?

29:07.170 --> 29:08.170
A TV coupon.

29:12.100 --> 29:13.340
You actually pulled it off.

29:13.690 --> 29:15.260
I didn't become section chief

29:15.260 --> 29:16.410
for nothing.

29:36.340 --> 29:36.850
Wang Xiaoman.

29:40.271 --> 29:41.737
Let's go pick a TV cabinet.

29:42.410 --> 29:43.160
It's fake.

29:58.000 --> 29:58.580
Fei Ni!

30:00.820 --> 30:02.260
Do you two take me for a fool?

30:02.820 --> 30:04.540
You gave me a fake TV coupon!

30:04.540 --> 30:05.500
How could you?

30:11.820 --> 30:13.260
I thought I drew it pretty well.

30:13.580 --> 30:14.610
How did she spot it?

30:15.820 --> 30:17.020
Fang Muyang!

30:17.020 --> 30:19.340
You actually made a fake one?

30:19.690 --> 30:20.890
I'll explain later.

30:22.020 --> 30:22.610
Chief Wang,

30:23.315 --> 30:24.260
please don't be angry.

30:24.890 --> 30:26.500
When I gave you that coupon,

30:26.500 --> 30:27.210
I told you

30:27.540 --> 30:28.820
that in ten days,

30:29.048 --> 30:30.500
it could be exchanged for a TV.

30:31.610 --> 30:32.410
Fang Muyang,

30:32.580 --> 30:34.500
I know you hurt your head before,

30:34.515 --> 30:36.210
but did it make your skin thicker, too?

30:36.540 --> 30:37.410
How dare you

30:37.410 --> 30:38.810
still play games with me?

30:39.540 --> 30:40.290
Let me ask you,

30:40.410 --> 30:42.560
where am I supposed
to redeem this fake coupon?

30:43.020 --> 30:44.690
What if I try to use it
and they find out?

30:44.980 --> 30:45.820
Are you trying to

30:45.820 --> 30:46.410
ruin me?

30:46.410 --> 30:47.610
Chief Wang,

30:48.210 --> 30:49.020
we gave you our word.

30:53.580 --> 30:54.100
Fine.

30:55.100 --> 30:56.300
I'll trust you one more time.

30:56.300 --> 30:57.740
But if this falls through again,

30:57.740 --> 30:58.540
mark my words.

30:58.982 --> 30:59.871
Your brother...

31:16.370 --> 31:17.410
Don't panic.

31:18.315 --> 31:19.890
Where there's a will, there's a way.

31:20.370 --> 31:22.300
We're not out of options yet.

31:27.540 --> 31:28.060
But...

31:28.410 --> 31:29.930
A TV coupon costs five hundred.

31:30.848 --> 31:33.170
Even with your sister's money,
we're still short seventy.

31:33.980 --> 31:35.130
Another ten days

31:35.130 --> 31:36.210
until the next payday.

31:37.170 --> 31:38.740
It's simply not enough.

31:44.020 --> 31:45.780
We'll have to think of something else.

32:22.170 --> 32:22.930
Can't sleep?

32:27.170 --> 32:28.980
Still worrying about the TV coupon?

32:38.580 --> 32:39.130
Fei Ni...

32:41.450 --> 32:42.980
What do you think marriage means?

32:50.471 --> 32:51.370
What does it mean?

32:52.580 --> 32:53.650
One mind falls short.

32:55.610 --> 32:56.580
Two minds go further.

32:57.580 --> 32:58.780
Since we're married,

32:59.210 --> 33:00.820
your problem is my problem.

33:01.610 --> 33:02.980
We'll figure it out together.

33:15.210 --> 33:15.890
I understand.

33:28.580 --> 33:29.020
Good night.

33:32.210 --> 33:32.730
Good night.

33:37.300 --> 33:39.820
(Jiangnan University,
Teaching Building No. 1)

33:39.820 --> 33:40.610
Professor Wu.

33:44.650 --> 33:45.210
What is it?

33:45.610 --> 33:46.130
Professor Wu,

33:46.693 --> 33:48.820
I'd like to request a transfer
out of Luo Min's group.

33:49.890 --> 33:50.580
Why?

33:51.170 --> 33:53.170
I've already studied and absorbed

33:53.170 --> 33:54.610
the previous findings from your team.

33:55.210 --> 33:57.540
I hope to transfer
into your group instead.

33:58.300 --> 33:58.690
I know.

33:59.210 --> 34:00.170
With your ability,

34:00.170 --> 34:02.540
that work is beneath your potential.

34:02.980 --> 34:03.610
But right now,

34:03.890 --> 34:05.410
I really can't take you into my team.

34:06.340 --> 34:06.850
Why?

34:07.580 --> 34:09.060
Is it still because of my background?

34:09.420 --> 34:09.860
No, no.

34:10.130 --> 34:12.020
Your background is no longer an issue.

34:12.610 --> 34:13.980
I've been informed by higher-ups.

34:14.210 --> 34:15.020
Our project team

34:15.020 --> 34:17.100
will soon merge
with Jiangcheng University's team.

34:17.420 --> 34:18.460
When that happens,

34:18.460 --> 34:20.170
the core members
will be reassigned there.

34:20.810 --> 34:21.940
You just got married,

34:22.380 --> 34:23.980
and Qu Hua is a doctor
here in Jiangnan.

34:23.982 --> 34:25.690
There's no way you can
move to Jiangcheng.

34:25.690 --> 34:26.330
I can.

34:27.900 --> 34:29.020
Professor Wu, I really can.

34:29.170 --> 34:30.380
If the team needs me,

34:30.380 --> 34:31.460
I can transfer anytime.

34:31.900 --> 34:32.330
No.

34:32.690 --> 34:33.420
And Qu Hua...

34:33.420 --> 34:35.060
No need to worry about my personal life.

34:36.810 --> 34:37.290
If you can

34:37.380 --> 34:39.130
come with us to Jiangcheng,

34:39.330 --> 34:40.380
that would be ideal.

34:41.130 --> 34:41.650
Alright.

34:41.860 --> 34:43.020
Talk it over with Qu Hua.

34:43.020 --> 34:43.460
If he

34:43.860 --> 34:44.650
agrees with this,

34:45.100 --> 34:46.580
you can lead a team of your own.

34:46.580 --> 34:47.580
No need to discuss it.

34:47.580 --> 34:49.290
I can give you my word right now.

34:50.900 --> 34:51.330
Very well.

34:51.980 --> 34:53.420
Thank you, Professor Wu.

35:12.100 --> 35:12.650
You're back.

35:13.293 --> 35:14.650
Dinner's kept warm in the pot.

35:14.770 --> 35:16.610
Mom and Dad were
called back to the unit.

35:17.460 --> 35:18.130
Where's Grandma?

35:19.610 --> 35:20.210
She's asleep.

35:22.100 --> 35:23.940
Give me a few more days
on this math paper.

35:24.290 --> 35:26.380
There are too many
technical terms to translate.

35:37.810 --> 35:38.290
Qu Hua,

35:39.020 --> 35:39.770
I'm sorry.

35:49.226 --> 35:49.960
What's wrong?

35:55.020 --> 35:57.020
Sometimes, I feel like I'm too selfish.

35:58.493 --> 36:00.420
You don't have to help me
translate anymore.

36:02.380 --> 36:03.900
But I can finish this one tonight...

37:01.540 --> 37:03.690
Mao Zedong Thought,

37:04.210 --> 37:06.330
like sunlight and rain,

37:06.500 --> 37:08.810
nourishes the university campus.

37:11.130 --> 37:11.940
Ling Yi.

37:15.070 --> 37:15.650
Son,

37:16.130 --> 37:17.910
look at what Ling Yi wrote.

37:18.810 --> 37:19.690
I've read it, Mom.

37:19.730 --> 37:22.260
(The blazing red military flag
waves in the wind.)

37:22.710 --> 37:24.080
(The people's army...)

37:25.030 --> 37:26.450
Just look at that.

37:26.980 --> 37:27.840
Ling Yi,

37:29.170 --> 37:30.720
you're only an intern,

37:30.900 --> 37:33.380
and your article already made page two.

37:33.730 --> 37:35.070
You truly are gifted.

37:35.980 --> 37:37.810
It's mostly thanks
to Uncle Fu's support.

37:37.980 --> 37:39.290
I just benefited from it.

37:41.100 --> 37:43.930
Come to think of it, I'd love to visit
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory

37:43.930 --> 37:44.770
to gather material.

37:44.770 --> 37:46.915
Maybe I'll write an interview piece
on you, Mrs. Ye.

37:46.990 --> 37:48.930
It might even make the front page.

37:49.650 --> 37:51.170
No need for a personal interview.

37:51.182 --> 37:53.020
But you're welcome
to write about our factory.

37:53.170 --> 37:54.690
We'd be delighted.

37:57.210 --> 37:58.170
Ye Feng,

37:58.580 --> 38:01.100
you should learn
a thing or two from Ling Yi.

38:05.900 --> 38:06.380
Ling Yi,

38:06.940 --> 38:08.900
what do you usually read?

38:09.130 --> 38:10.420
Recommend some books to Ye Feng.

38:11.380 --> 38:11.940
Sure.

38:12.580 --> 38:13.420
Ye Feng,

38:13.610 --> 38:14.940
I'll borrow a few books for you

38:14.940 --> 38:16.100
from the university library.

38:17.810 --> 38:18.420
Ye Feng,

38:19.020 --> 38:20.810
did you hear what Ling Yi said?

38:21.500 --> 38:22.540
Yeah, yeah, I heard.

38:25.290 --> 38:26.290
Then it's settled.

38:26.690 --> 38:28.540
Ye Feng is in your hands now.

38:28.940 --> 38:29.580
Alright.

38:31.648 --> 38:32.730
Careful not to cut yourself.

38:41.020 --> 38:42.290
What are you so happy about?

38:43.610 --> 38:44.980
How could the Educated Youth Office

38:45.130 --> 38:46.940
assign you to a milk station?

38:47.610 --> 38:49.810
A grown man working
among a bunch of women?

38:50.130 --> 38:51.210
That is silly.

38:52.210 --> 38:53.900
Washing milk bottles isn't so bad.

38:54.170 --> 38:55.650
After finally landing a job,

38:55.980 --> 38:57.250
it turns out to be temporary.

38:57.940 --> 38:59.380
That's not a long-term plan.

38:59.980 --> 39:01.690
A temporary job beats no job.

39:02.137 --> 39:03.182
Let's start there.

39:03.540 --> 39:04.980
Things will get better.

39:07.770 --> 39:08.980
When we get home,

39:09.130 --> 39:10.770
don't mention that it's temporary.

39:12.060 --> 39:12.420
Okay.

39:16.800 --> 39:17.650
Lin Mei's back.

39:17.850 --> 39:18.330
Mr. Li.

39:18.330 --> 39:18.915
Good, good.

39:19.770 --> 39:20.250
Mom.

39:20.940 --> 39:21.310
Dad.

39:21.360 --> 39:22.000
Mrs. Lin.

39:22.330 --> 39:22.960
Mr. Lin.

39:24.980 --> 39:27.090
I said I'd bring
Fei Ting home for dinner.

39:27.182 --> 39:28.290
This is all we're having?

39:28.770 --> 39:30.770
There are so many mouths to feed.

39:30.770 --> 39:32.580
We can't eat well at every meal.

39:33.730 --> 39:34.540
Exactly.

39:35.048 --> 39:36.330
Your little nephew's growing,

39:36.330 --> 39:37.330
and he hasn't complained.

39:37.980 --> 39:39.100
Why are you being so picky?

39:39.620 --> 39:40.320
Mr. Lin, Mrs. Lin,

39:40.500 --> 39:42.460
these are gifts I brought for you.

39:43.250 --> 39:44.900
Fei Ting, you don't even have a job yet.

39:44.900 --> 39:46.450
How could you spend money like this?

39:47.270 --> 39:48.640
Fei Ting already found a job.

39:49.690 --> 39:50.530
He did?

39:56.580 --> 39:57.420
Sit down and eat.

39:58.460 --> 39:59.650
Honey, serve the noodles.

39:59.860 --> 40:00.690
Coming, coming.

40:01.690 --> 40:02.330
Here, here.

40:02.900 --> 40:03.460
Eat.

40:03.690 --> 40:04.250
Fei Ting,

40:05.130 --> 40:07.290
where were you assigned to work?

40:09.737 --> 40:10.515
The milk station.

40:10.770 --> 40:11.610
Raising cows?

40:12.580 --> 40:13.330
Washing bottles.

40:14.460 --> 40:15.250
Washing bottles?

40:15.980 --> 40:17.290
A grown man washing milk bottles?

40:17.290 --> 40:18.160
Embarrassing.

40:19.250 --> 40:20.330
What's so embarrassing?

40:21.330 --> 40:22.980
There's no hierarchy in honest work.

40:23.730 --> 40:24.940
What's wrong with his job?

40:24.940 --> 40:27.170
People get clean milk to drink

40:27.170 --> 40:29.060
because of workers like Fei Ting.

40:30.170 --> 40:31.900
Pretty words don't change anything.

40:32.130 --> 40:33.500
Can he compare to Wang Tengda?

40:35.290 --> 40:35.900
Besides,

40:36.500 --> 40:38.730
how can a milk station compare
to the transport team?

40:38.730 --> 40:39.650
Can he compare?

40:39.650 --> 40:41.650
Song, why bring up Wang Tengda?

40:41.980 --> 40:42.890
Leave him out of this.

40:48.160 --> 40:48.730
Fei Ting,

40:49.250 --> 40:50.210
didn't you know?

40:50.540 --> 40:51.250
Not long ago,

40:51.250 --> 40:52.980
someone introduced
a match to our Lin Mei.

40:52.980 --> 40:54.580
He works for the city transport team,

40:54.580 --> 40:56.580
and he could even
arrange a job for her brother.

40:58.580 --> 40:59.330
Come on.

40:59.330 --> 41:00.860
Eat up.

41:07.060 --> 41:07.900
Mr. Lin, Mrs. Lin,

41:08.170 --> 41:08.940
about that guy,

41:09.380 --> 41:10.060
Wang, was it?

41:10.330 --> 41:11.500
Lin Mei didn't mention him.

41:12.330 --> 41:12.940
But I do know

41:13.071 --> 41:14.980
there's no way
she'd fall for someone else.

41:15.460 --> 41:16.380
Please don't worry.

41:17.380 --> 41:18.770
I'll make sure Lin Mei is happy.

41:25.690 --> 41:26.170
You all eat.

41:26.580 --> 41:27.130
I'm leaving.

41:28.380 --> 41:29.540
All talk.

41:30.940 --> 41:32.100
Nothing to show,

41:32.204 --> 41:33.515
but plenty of temper.

41:34.130 --> 41:34.650
Lin Mei!

41:34.770 --> 41:35.330
Mom.

41:35.330 --> 41:35.860
Forget them.

41:36.790 --> 41:37.500
Fei Ting!

41:37.730 --> 41:38.400
Fei Ting!

41:41.137 --> 41:42.740
You were really something back there.

41:44.380 --> 41:44.900
Lin Mei,

41:45.650 --> 41:47.290
I can't promise anything about work,

41:47.730 --> 41:49.330
but when it comes to us, I'm certain.

41:53.290 --> 41:54.100
How do you know

41:54.100 --> 41:55.580
I wouldn't fall for someone else?

41:58.900 --> 41:59.900
I just know.

42:02.604 --> 42:04.300
Whatever you end up doing,
I'll follow you.

42:04.580 --> 42:06.130
Even if you were scooping sewage!

42:08.471 --> 42:08.920
Come on.

42:09.026 --> 42:10.230
Let's get scallion oil noodles.

42:10.320 --> 42:10.782
Let's go.

42:22.860 --> 42:23.380
(Ms. Liu...)

42:24.530 --> 42:26.500
Something's come up at home.

42:26.730 --> 42:28.050
I urgently need money.

42:28.530 --> 42:30.530
I can't come up
with that much right now.

42:30.690 --> 42:33.300
Could you help me out?

42:37.300 --> 42:37.730
Fei Ni,

42:39.860 --> 42:41.300
it's not that I don't want to help.

42:41.820 --> 42:43.530
You know our situation.

42:43.730 --> 42:46.020
We're supporting
four elders and two children.

42:46.300 --> 42:48.860
My husband and I are still
squeezed into temporary housing.

42:49.210 --> 42:50.940
Our combined salaries each month

42:50.940 --> 42:52.090
barely cover expenses.

42:52.690 --> 42:54.420
There's no savings to speak of.

42:56.730 --> 42:58.300
If you're really in a bind,

42:59.090 --> 43:00.130
you could ask Ye Feng.

43:00.340 --> 43:02.340
He draws a salary
and has no real burdens.

43:02.530 --> 43:04.690
He's probably better off
than the rest of us.

43:05.650 --> 43:06.460
And besides,

43:07.090 --> 43:09.090
didn't you two date before?

43:09.090 --> 43:11.340
He'd surely do you that favor.

43:12.130 --> 43:13.380
I'll think of another way.

43:13.380 --> 43:14.340
Thank you, Ms. Liu.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
